  "details": "We can not learn from our mistakes if we do not know what the mistake is. Better defining what activated the suspension, will help the people who want to be good community members.\n\nEx: World, Avatar, Texture, Asset, Text, prefab, thumbnail. \n\nAs of late I have a one week suspension, and I only know it was due to a world of mine because a friend had told me it had been removed. Though the world has nothing that breaks TOS (That I can think of) I don't know if I can re upload it because I do not know what about it broke TOS and when, as I am always updating the world. \n\nHaving this additional info would help with this.",
